[6:22AM] #LagAbkExpWay
#AbuleEgba
#TrafficUpdate

Traffic is very encouraging coming from the Tollgate through Moshalasi , Alakuko, Meiran, Ijaye, Ahamadiyya and connecting Abule Egba Jubilee bridge towards Super/Ilepo.

It's a bit slow but beneath Abule Egba bridge due to traffic light alternation.
Navigating through Charity junction is better aside another slight alternation delay at Charity junction.

Proceeding towards Abattoir is better for now.
Ilepo is also slightly busy due to the activities of the commercial buses.

The return journey from Ilepo through Abule Egba jubilee bridge en route Tollgate is traffic free.
